Subject: sunxi: H713: port the guarded HDMI MIPS handoff to V2

Relocate the trace hooks and trampoline transfers to the authenticated
native V2 firmware. Keep the original-word and scratch-register checks
and select the table only after the board-specific firmware hash passes.

Select source 3 explicitly from the live V2 channel table, then wait for
CPU_COMM RETURN and the asynchronous source worker. Export the PID to the
temporary boot script only after both trace canaries and completion agree.

